### Finding

- **Medium, blocker** — [review_bundle.go](/var/tmp/pose-work-go/pose-review-run-2783063900/worktree/pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_bundle.go:1977) copies `accepted_limits` into the sealed plan, but omits it from the bundle’s `plan_digest` input. Different limits can therefore share the same plan digest, contrary to R1/D2. The outer bundle digest includes the limits, but does not satisfy the separate plan-digest requirement.

